{"term": {"label": "德", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-ii", "title": "萬章下", "description": "孟子曰：「伯夷，目不視惡色，耳不聽惡聲。非其君不事，非其民不使。治則進，亂則退。橫政之所出，橫民之所止，不忍居也。思與鄉人處，如以朝衣朝冠坐於塗炭也。當紂之時，居北海之濱，以待天下之清也。故聞伯夷之風者，頑夫廉，懦夫有立志。\n「伊尹曰：『何事非君？何使非民？』治亦進，亂亦進。曰：『天之生斯民也，使先知覺後知，使先覺覺後", "occurrences": 2, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "乘", "id": "乘"}, {"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "云", "id": "云"}, {"form": "位", "id": "位"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "友", "id": "友"}, {"form": "受", "id": "受"}, {"form": "古", "id": "古"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "善士", "id": "善士"}, {"form": "地", "id": "地"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "天子", "id": "天子"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "家", "id": "家"}, {"form": "德", "variants": [], "id": "德"}, {"form": "挾", "id": "挾"}, {"form": "條理", "id": "條理"}, {"form": "獵", "id": "獵"}, {"form": "男", "id": "男"}, {"form": "終", "id": "終"}, {"form": "聖", "id": "聖"}, {"form": "視", "id": "視"}, {"form": "較", "id": "較"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}, {"form": "里", "id": "里"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.583997552432231, "source": "視", "target": "受"}, {"weight": 3.6826098411003407, "source": "視", "target": "地"}, {"weight": 2.3608540011180215, "source": "視", "target": "天子"}, {"weight": 2.178532444324067, "source": "視", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 2.583997552432231, "source": "視", "target": "男"}, {"weight": 3.054001181677967, "source": "地", "target": "天子"}, {"weight": 2.0243817644968085, "source": "地", "target": "里"}, {"weight": 2.583997552432231, "source": "地", "target": "受"}, {"weight": 2.178532444324067, "source": "地", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 2.583997552432231, "source": "地", "target": "男"}, {"weight": 3.2771447329921766, "source": "家", "target": "乘"}, {"weight": 1.955388893009857, "source": "家", "target": "友"}, {"weight": 1.1977031913123406, "source": "男", "target": "位"}, {"weight": 3.5648268054439574, "source": "男", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 